eas on what shoes to wear. I&#039;m thinking flip flops with some bling? But am open to suggestions (and links of where to order them)\n\nNothing too expensive, as no one will really be seeing the shoes anyway.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886602,"PostDate":1424197122,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!! I'm getting married on the beach and am looking for ideas on what shoes to wear. I'm thinking flip flops with some bling? But am open to suggestions (and links of where to order them)<br>\nNothing too expensive, as no one will really be seeing the shoes anyway.<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424114250,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1431296225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78805,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c723da2354e49aa5b171738e87d56707","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@KatieMcBride&amp;nbsp; Congrats on your upcoming wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love the look of the barefoot sandals!&amp;nbsp; Like these from esty&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/217691087\/35-sale-beaded-barefoot-sandals-bridal?ref=sc_3&amp;amp;plkey=59c6a15263ec928014e98ce7cf7cec587c9f94aa%3A217691087&amp;amp;ga_search_query=barefoot+sandal&amp;amp;ga_ref=auto1&amp;amp;ga_search_type=all&amp;amp;ga_view_type=gallery&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/217691087\/35-sale-beaded-barefoot-sandals-bridal?ref=sc_3&amp;amp;plkey=59c6a15263ec928014e98ce7cf7cec587c9f94aa%3A217691087&amp;amp;ga_search_query=barefoot+sandal&amp;amp;ga_ref=auto1&amp;amp;ga_search_type=all&amp;amp;ga_view_type=gallery&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you browse enough through esty or just google you can find them in a million styles if you really like them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love DIY projects esp for personalized items like your wedding shoes! I found this super easy cute beach look i think you could customize yourself and no one else will have :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/youtu.be\/zr1ldiLCd-U&#039;&gt;http:\/\/youtu.be\/zr1ldiLCd-U&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886608,"PostDate":1424199771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@KatieMcBride\u00a0 Congrats on your upcoming wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love the look of the barefoot sandals!\u00a0 Like these from esty<a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/217691087\/35-sale-beaded-barefoot-sandals-bridal?ref=sc_3&plkey=59c6a15263ec928014e98ce7cf7cec587c9f94aa%3A217691087&ga_search_query=barefoot+sandal&ga_ref=auto1&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ew_type=gallery<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you browse enough through esty or just google you can find them in a million styles if you really like them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love DIY projects esp for personalized items like your wedding shoes! I found this super easy cute beach look i think you could customize yourself and no one else will have <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/youtu.be\/zr1ldiLCd-U' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/youtu.be\/zr1ldiLCd-U<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422632988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78805,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4b415910af60f01101c55c973bbfee5","RawContent":"This is my something blue. I would laugh if I lost my flip flop to the sand or it was slapping my heels as I walked lol I&#039;m clumsy.","Attachments":[{"Id":30640,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-278120-0-04639000-1424203319.jpg","S