> User Jaycee31 (282805)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e68f9b04cea34a21a3ad4bd9b76e22a","RawContent":"I am VERY excited to be going back! :) can&#039;t wait to be back by the adult pool or down by the beach :) :) or dancing on an evening! \n\nWe booked ours through a travel agent here in the uk at the beginning of July so waiting to hear on an exact wedding date and to get an email address for one of the wedding planners. \n\nWe are going with the gazebo because that&#039;s where he proposed and as you will know it&#039;s very nice and private. Looking at the cocktail hour after that and then meal in restaurant I think. Sorted a reception out for when we get home.  How about you? And have you booked or looked at booking anyone for hair and makeup? X\n[quote name=\"Deanine\" post=\"1863954\" timestamp=\"1406915708\"]\nCongratulations everyone!  I&#039;m getting married at the Grand Palladium in March 2015.  \nAnyone hear any reviews on their spa?  I&#039;m a little nervous to just go with them because I cant find reviews on their hair salon.  Is anyone going with an outside vendor?  If so, how much does it cost to bring them onsite for the morning?[\/quote] \nHi Deanine!\n\nI am also looking for reviews on the spa hair and makeup service but can&#039;t find any. The hotel charges you a rediculous amount of around 300usd to bring a vendor into the hotel. A lot of makeup artists around jamaica use airbrush which looks great but I don&#039;t know what they use in the spa..if you find out please let me know won&#039;t you :) how are your plans coming along? And congratulations!! :) \nKatie x","Attachments":[],"Id":1864488,"PostDate":1407185486,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am VERY excited to be going back! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> can't wait to be back by the adult pool or down by the beach <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> or dancing on an evening! <br><br>\nWe booked ours through a travel agent here in the uk at the beginning of July so waiting to hear on an exact wedding date and to get an email address for one of the wedding planners. <br><br>\nWe are going with the gazebo because that's where he proposed and as you will know it's very nice and private. Looking at the cocktail hour after that and then meal in restaurant I think. Sorted a reception out for when we get home.  How about you? And have you booked or looked at booking anyone for hair and makeup? X<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Deanine, on 01 August 2014 - 09:55 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congratulations everyone! \u00a0I'm getting married at the Grand Palladium in March 2015. \u00a0<br>\nAnyone hear any reviews on their spa? \u00a0I'm a little nervous to just go with them because I cant find reviews on their hair salon. \u00a0Is anyone going with an outside vendor? \u00a0If so, how much does it cost to bring them onsite for the morning?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n <br>\nHi Deanine!<br><br>\nI am also looking for reviews on the spa hair and makeup service but can't find any. The hotel charges you a rediculous amount of around 300usd to bring a vendor into the hotel. A lot of makeup artists around jamaica use airbrush which looks great but I don't know what they use in the spa..if you find out please let me know won't you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> how are your plans coming along? And congratulations!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br>\nKatie x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"loopykatz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381270370,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274100.jpg?_r=1406583827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katieals","Id":274100,"Name":"katieals","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d35aec79b73cfd2d9a39774e5d0c27e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"katieals\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve read some reviews and spoken to someone who&#039;s been to a wedding there. &amp;nbsp;Nobody seemed to be happy with the hair styling, at least not thrilled and someone even took their hair out and redid it. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve eben hearing great reviews about Rashel from Chasity Artistry so that is who I just ended up booking. &amp;nbsp;When I spoke with her she said that a lot of the resorts know her and most of the time you can just get her a day pass if you&#039;re nice to your coordinator :) &amp;nbsp;I thought it was worth the risk of paying a little extra. &amp;nbsp;Plus, you&#039;re saving money on the hair anyway so it should come close to evening out. &amp;nbsp;And I felt more comfortable going with someone who has great reviews and pictures of work she has done. &amp;nbsp;She&#039;s on Facebook too so you can see her work, just look up Chaisty Artistry. &amp;nbsp;Here is the email I received from her regarding pricing and makeup applciation.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#800000;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;There is a us200 base rate this includes the brides makeup, lashes and my travel from Kingston then it&#039;s us75 per hair and us75 per makeup bridesmaid makeup.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#800000;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;yes you get to choose airbrush or regular but it is the same price. Lashes are included. They know me very well at the resort so just be nice to your wedding planner and you will only be charged for day passes!! iv seen it happen lots of times instead of the 300&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864575,"PostDate":1407243871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274100\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274100-katieals\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">katieals<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've read some reviews and spoken to someone who's been to a wedding there. \u00a0Nobody seemed to be happy with the hair styling, at least not thrilled and someone even took their hair out and redid it. \u00a0I've eben hearing great reviews about Rashel from Chasity Artistry so that is who I just ended up booking. \u00a0When I spoke with her she said that a lot of the resorts know her and most of the time you can just get her a day pass if you're nice to your coordinator <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0I thought it was worth the risk of paying a little extra. \u00a0Plus, you're saving money on the hair anyway so it should come close to evening out. \u00a0And I felt more comfortable going with someone who has great reviews and pictures of work she has done. \u00a0She's on Facebook too so you can see her work, just look up Chaisty Artistry. \u00a0Here is the email I received from her regarding pricing and makeup applciation.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#800000\"><span  style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, 'Lucida Grande', sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">There is a us200 base rate this includes the brides makeup, lashes and my travel from Kingston then it's us75 per hair and us75 per makeup bridesmaid makeup.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#800000\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">yes you get to choose airbrush or regular but it is the same price. Lashes are included. They know me very well at the resort so just be nice to your wedding planner and you will only be charged for day passes!! iv seen it happen lots of times instead of the 300<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deanine.sinisgalli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406915296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deanine","Id":279251,"Name":"Deanine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1412807386,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce8c4d64f488c1d3bbb8f0ebeb60e594","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just wanted to let you know when I first booked my wedding at the grand palladium, I had created a page on facebook for grand palladium brides, problem is I didnt know any! LOL &amp;nbsp;But, when I was looking at iberostar for the wedding i saw that they had one and I thought it was such a great idea. &amp;nbsp;I know we have the forum here, but sometimes it cant get a bit difficult to find things. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve uploaded and will continue to upload documents containing prices and information for for everything to do with having your wedding in Jamaica at the grand palladium. &amp;nbsp;Please feel free to add to these documents and submit new info! &amp;nbsp;The more people that join the more information we&#039;ll have. &amp;nbsp;If know of any past brides, please let them know too as information from them would be a great value!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations again, everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864794,"PostDate":1407334558,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wanted to let you know when I first booked my wedding at the grand palladium, I had created a page on facebook for grand palladium brides, problem is I didnt know any! LOL \u00a0But, when I was looking at iberostar for the wedding i saw that they had one and I thought it was such a great idea. \u00a0I know we have the forum here, but sometimes it cant get a bit difficult to find things. \u00a0I've uploaded and will continue to upload documents containing prices and information for for everything to do with having your wedding in Jamaica at the grand palladium. \u00a0Please feel free to add to these documents and submit new info! \u00a0The more people that join the more information we'll have. \u00a0If know of any past brides, please let them know too as information from them would be a great value!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations again, everyone!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deanine.sinisgalli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406915296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deanine","Id":279251,"Name":"Deanine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.126.113.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3a0f0149b4ce507cdafbac1ff45bc4b","RawContent":"Hi ladies \n\n\nI was married at gp jamaica in april this year and would be happy to help you with anything i can it is much easyer for me to get on facebook so if you would like to add me im vicki povah\n\n\nPs my wedding pics are on there too \n\n\nCongrats to you all xx","Attachments":[],"Id":1875416,"PostDate":1413151417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies <br><br>\nI was married at gp jamaica in april this year and would be happy to help you with anything i can it is much easyer for me to get on facebook so if you would like to add me im vicki povah<br><br>\nPs my wedding pics are on there too <br><br>\nCongrats to you all xx \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.10.210.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77521,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"409478e86496a138a6a64368116d8bbf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! and all the best for the BIG day! If you are considering destination wedding cinematography I would definately reccomend Epic Weddings Jamaica,email them at epicweddingsja@[member=\"gmail\"].com, they make beautiful videos and ive heard they are quite affordable, I&#039;&#039;m looking to book them for my wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881884,"PostDate":1420491178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! and all the best for the BIG day! If you are considering destination wedding cinematography I would definately reccomend Epic Weddings Jamaica,email them at epicweddingsja@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com, they make beautiful videos and ive heard they are quite affordable, I''m looking to book them for my wedding!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffandjo16@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.10.210.137","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420487782,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TiffiBride16","Id":281611,"Name":"TiffiBride16","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
