;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Me! we're booking this week for April 2014!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1357851428770_1167\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> btw I'm new here\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a2c5a1b27a79a5d709d3c77dcfad0cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; ive heard on other websites and forum that it can take a few weeks to get a response from them which can be frustrating although this is supposed to be because they spend a lot time with you while you are thee to make sure everything is perfect I suppose I can live with that ha. Have you any ides yet in date location etc? oohh and big congratulations xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1704098,"PostDate":1357918666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> ive heard on other websites and forum that it can take a few weeks to get a response from them which can be frustrating although this is supposed to be because they spend a lot time with you while you are thee to make sure everything is perfect I suppose I can live with that ha. Have you any ides yet in date location etc? oohh and big congratulations xx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d9627d07ca3a1b330a97b4327617dbb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We just spoke to our travel agent yesterday and we&#039;re going from April 5-12 2014. Wedding date set for April 7, but I haven&#039;t spoke to the coordinator there yet.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m wondering what the private dinner reception prices are like. I heard it includes a dinner in the a la carte restaurants but it isn&#039;t private&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1704187,"PostDate":1357923939,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We just spoke to our travel agent yesterday and we're going from April 5-12 2014. Wedding date set for April 7, but I haven't spoke to the coordinator there yet.<\/p> <p> I'm wondering what the private dinner reception prices are like. I heard it includes a dinner in the a la carte restaurants but it isn't private<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4af1cc49de4f8d19417ec40e8c64a33","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats to you both!!&amp;nbsp; The only planning that I have done is to determine what resort I wanted the wedding to be held at.&amp;nbsp; My fiance and&amp;nbsp;I travel to a resort in Negril yearly so having the wedding in Jamaica was a no brainer for us.&amp;nbsp; What I didn&#039;t expect to be so hard was trying to narrow it&amp;nbsp;down to one resort.&amp;nbsp;It seems like everyone I looked at there were pros and cons.. I really wanted to be married in Negril on the beach at Bloody Bay and needed to find someplace that was not \"couples only\".&amp;nbsp; Our adult kids will be coming along as well as nieces and nephews. My top choice was the Riu Tropical Bay in Negril but it can get pretty expensive and I did not like the backup location if it happened to rain,however the beach&amp;nbsp;(Bloody Bay) is amazing!&amp;nbsp; The Lady Hamilton is so much better for our budget as I&#039;m sure we will need to assist the kids with the travel expenses.&amp;nbsp;We can also book a Honeymoon Suite for much less than the standard room at the Riu. The big downside is the beach is nowhere near as pretty as it is in Negril.&amp;nbsp; I have picked the Lady Hamilton because I could see myself getting married at any of the locations they provide.&amp;nbsp;Even if it happened to rain the backup location at the spa looks beautiful!&amp;nbsp; Right now I am thinking of choosing the gazebo overlooking the ocean as my location.&amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t wait to hear back from them regarding our date.&amp;nbsp; I know that it&#039;s going to be a pretty popular date (12-13-14)&amp;nbsp;so that is why I am trying to reserve it so far in advance.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1704193,"PostDate":1357924550,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats to you both!!\u00a0 The only planning that I have done is to determine what resort I wanted the wedding to be held at.\u00a0 My fiance and\u00a0I travel to a resort in Negril yearly so having the wedding in Jamaica was a no brainer for us.\u00a0 What I didn't expect to be so hard was trying to narrow it\u00a0down to one resort.\u00a0It seems like everyone I looked at there were pros and cons.. I really wanted to be married in Negril on the beach at Bloody Bay and needed to find someplace that was not \"couples only\".\u00a0 Our adult kids will be coming along as well as nieces and nephews. My top choice was the Riu Tropical Bay in Negril but it can get pretty expensive and I did not like the backup location if it happened to rain,however the beach\u00a0(Bloody Bay) is amazing!\u00a0 The Lady Hamilton is so much better for our budget as I'm sure we will need to assist the kids with the travel expenses.\u00a0We can also book a Honeymoon Suite for much less than the standard room at the Riu. The big downside is the beach is nowhere near as pretty as it is in Negril.\u00a0 I have picked the Lady Hamilton because I could see myself getting married at any of the locations they provide.\u00a0Even if it happened to rain the backup location at the spa looks beautiful!\u00a0 Right now I am thinking of choosing the gazebo overlooking the ocean as my location.\u00a0I can't wait to hear back from them regarding our date.\u00a0 I know that it's going to be a pretty popular date (12-13-14)\u00a0so that is why I am trying to reserve it so far in advance.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"serifenorfleat@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.154.13.128","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1356713159,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263567.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snorfle1","Id":263567,"Name":"snorfle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa8d60ad4a24c5c462971223aca67add","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve been waiting to book, it&#039;s so tough trying to decide! I have 3 places narrowed down, and this is one of them. I didn&#039;t think anyone would be booking for 2014 yet!!! Now I feel like I&#039;m behind...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1704844,"PostDate":1358052577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've been waiting to book, it's so tough trying to decide! I have 3 places narrowed down, and this is one of them. I didn't think anyone would be booking for 2014 yet!!! Now I feel like I'm behind...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77604923d987cfeda58b2392c11aab60","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; its mad how you think you are doing well and then come on here to see people did things a while ago we are very much restricted at the moment to the w\/c and our travel agent once our date and time have been confirmed then i will relax a little I think. MJCF i will be there on the 7th if you end up having your wedding there oohh exciting xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1704914,"PostDate":1358087728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> its mad how you think you are doing well and then come on here to see people did things a while ago we are very much restricted at the moment to the w\/c and our travel agent once our date and time have been confirmed then i will relax a little I think. MJCF i will be there on the 7th if you end up having your wedding there oohh exciting xx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a33c6fb2635bc04dbab78be489316345","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Mrs P, that is when I will relax as well!&amp;nbsp; Good luck with the rest of your planning :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1705004,"PostDate":1358100707,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Mrs P, that is when I will relax as well!\u00a0 Good luck with the rest of your planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"serifenorfleat@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.154.13.128","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1356713159,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263567.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snorfle1","Id":263567,"Name":"snorfle1","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"71738","Title":"any 2014 grand palladium jamaica brides about yet?","LastPostDate":1405474210},"Pages":{"TotalItems":164,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
