p 2 be[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n its mad how you think you are doing well and then come on here to see people did things a while ago we are very much restricted at the moment to the w\/c and our travel agent once our date and time have been confirmed then i will relax a little I think. MJCF i will be there on the 7th if you end up having your wedding there oohh exciting xx[\/quote] \n Very exciting! We will be booking this week, we just need a few more details. The wedding date isn&#039;t set in stone yet, but we will be there for that week!","Attachments":[],"Id":1705315,"PostDate":1358173942,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrs p 2 be<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> its mad how you think you are doing well and then come on here to see people did things a while ago we are very much restricted at the moment to the w\/c and our travel agent once our date and time have been confirmed then i will relax a little I think. MJCF i will be there on the 7th if you end up having your wedding there oohh exciting xx<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Very exciting! We will be booking this week, we just need a few more details. The wedding date isn't set in stone yet, but we will be there for that week!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","