{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb31786bb53678b6d9f484c2fae069b4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi everyone!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am getting married at the GP on May 9th, 2014 at 4 PM on the beach!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m so glad someone started this post for 2014 brides :)&amp;nbsp; I have been in contact with people at the GP, so I have received a lot of info from them.&amp;nbsp; If anyone has any questions, feel free to ask!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For the Ontario, Canada brides, do you mind me asking who is your travel agent?&amp;nbsp; And are there flights direct from Toronto?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1707720,"PostDate":1358523284,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi everyone!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am getting married at the GP on May 9th, 2014 at 4 PM on the beach!\u00a0 I'm so glad someone started this post for 2014 brides <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I have been in contact with people at the GP, so I have received a lot of info from them.\u00a0 If anyone has any questions, feel free to ask!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the Ontario, Canada brides, do you mind me asking who is your travel agent?\u00a0 And are there flights direct from Toronto?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"photogirl0403@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.180.236.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351559465,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261894.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":204,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photogirl0403","Id":261894,"Name":"photogirl0403","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9146b5ea0cb533e83fd9297da1c357a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]photogirl0403[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi everyone! \n \n I am getting married at the GP on May 9th, 2014 at 4 PM on the beach!  I&#039;m so glad someone started this post for 2014 brides :)  I have been in contact with people at the GP, so I have received a lot of info from them.  If anyone has any questions, feel free to ask!  \n \n For the Ontario, Canada brides, do you mind me asking who is your travel agent?  And are there flights direct from Toronto?[\/quote] \n Hi! I am from Ontario, flying direct from Toronto. I&#039;m using destinationweddings.com, dealing with Nikki, she&#039;s been great so far! I haven&#039;t been in touch with anyone at GP yet, do you know what the prices are like for a dinner reception?","Attachments":[],"Id":1707762,"PostDate":1358527655,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>photogirl0403<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi everyone!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am getting married at the GP on May 9th, 2014 at 4 PM on the beach!\u00a0 I'm so glad someone started this post for 2014 brides <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I have been in contact with people at the GP, so I have received a lot of info from them.\u00a0 If anyone has any questions, feel free to ask!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the Ontario, Canada brides, do you mind me asking who is your travel agent?\u00a0 And are there flights direct from Toronto?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hi! I am from Ontario, flying direct from Toronto. I'm using destinationweddings.com, dealing with Nikki, she's been great so far! I haven't been in touch with anyone at GP yet, do you know what the prices are like for a dinner reception?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b1ed5580d7888d3f7df4dfab8a56395","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]photogirl0403[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi everyone! \n \n I am getting married at the GP on May 9th, 2014 at 4 PM on the beach!  I&#039;m so glad someone started this post for 2014 brides :)  I have been in contact with people at the GP, so I have received a lot of info from them.  If anyone has any questions, feel free to ask!  \n \n For the Ontario, Canada brides, do you mind me asking who is your travel agent?  And are there flights direct from Toronto?[\/quote] \n Congratulations! I have found this site so helpful in my planning.  I am a way early starter, have to wait until Dec 2014 for the big day..lol. I was planning on getting married at the beach until I saw the gazebo now I just don&#039;t know.  We will probably decide once we get there.","Attachments":[],"Id":1708037,"PostDate":1358558965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>photogirl0403<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi everyone!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am getting married at the GP on May 9th, 2014 at 4 PM on the beach!\u00a0 I'm so glad someone started this post for 2014 brides <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I have been in contact with people at the GP, so I have received a lot of info from them.\u00a0 If anyone has any questions, feel free to ask!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the Ontario, Canada brides, do you mind me asking who is your travel agent?\u00a0 And are there flights direct from Toronto?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Congratulations! I have found this site so helpful in my planning.\u00a0 I am a way early starter, have to wait until Dec 2014 for the big day..lol. I was planning on getting married at the beach until I saw the gazebo now I just don't know.\u00a0 We will probably decide once we get there.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"serifenorfleat@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.154.13.128","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1356713159,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263567.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snorfle1","Id":263567,"Name":"snorfle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55edb331fada6783fdd0105747d840af","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; congratulations to you all you us and canada brides seem to have it all covered im in the uk and unfortunately are waiting on my travel agent to arrange the basics cant wait till i get the wc email and I can deal direct happy planning people xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1708134,"PostDate":1358586783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> congratulations to you all you us and canada brides seem to have it all covered im in the uk and unfortunately are waiting on my travel agent to arrange the basics cant wait till i get the wc email and I can deal direct happy planning people xx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"440198713a902a5ce42199f43019f462","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sent out my information to my TA today, hopefully she comes back with some great quotes for this property!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709135,"PostDate":1358798553,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sent out my information to my TA today, hopefully she comes back with some great quotes for this property!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f96995ffd0ef122b0b2e0eff8fad9473","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrsjones2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sent out my information to my TA today, hopefully she comes back with some great quotes for this property![\/quote] \n Did you get your quotes yet?  We received ours for Dec 2014 but they seem pretty high. I am wondering if we wait longer then the rates will improve.","Attachments":[],"Id":1709821,"PostDate":1358894495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrsjones2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sent out my information to my TA today, hopefully she comes back with some great quotes for this property!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Did you get your quotes yet? \u00a0We received ours for Dec 2014 but they seem pretty high. I am wondering if we wait longer then the rates will improve.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"serifenorfleat@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.154.13.128","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1356713159,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263567.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snorfle1","Id":263567,"Name":"snorfle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d75cb4ca7be2411b01b6ef46f8ceb8d3","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]snorfle1[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Did you get your quotes yet?  We received ours for Dec 2014 but they seem pretty high. I am wondering if we wait longer then the rates will improve.[\/quote] \n Not yet, still waiting. I don&#039;t expect to hear from her for a couple days as she puts together different packages. We&#039;re flying out of Vancouver, but also have people from Toronto, Edinburgh, London and Sydney... We&#039;re a complicated bunch, lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1709891,"PostDate":1358903871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>snorfle1<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Did you get your quotes yet? \u00a0We received ours for Dec 2014 but they seem pretty high. I am wondering if we wait longer then the rates will improve.\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Not yet, still waiting. I don't expect to hear from her for a couple days as she puts together different packages. We're flying out of Vancouver, but also have people from Toronto, Edinburgh, London and Sydney... We're a complicated bunch, lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f615e0162776bef2718c989ed69e3ec0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yay!!!!!! had a phone call today our wedding date and time have been confirmed 12th april 2014 at 4pm so excited xxxx &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1711418,"PostDate":1359156856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yay!!!!!! had a phone call today our wedding date and time have been confirmed 12th april 2014 at 4pm so excited xxxx \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcc1ea59650eb3760d669297a8325c3a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrs p 2 be[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Yay!!!!!! had a phone call today our wedding date and time have been confirmed 12th april 2014 at 4pm so excited xxxx[\/quote] \n Great news!!!  I know I was so excited when I received my confirmation:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1711715,"PostDate":1359227881,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrs p 2 be<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Yay!!!!!! had a phone call today our wedding date and time have been confirmed 12th april 2014 at 4pm so excited xxxx \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Great news!!! \u00a0I know I was so excited when I received my confirmation:)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"serifenorfleat@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.154.13.128","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1356713159,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263567.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snorfle1","Id":263567,"Name":"snorfle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20b6d9db54fbc49bd4b355776b0e7265","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thank you im going dress shopping on monday!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; let the planning begin xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1711755,"PostDate":1359234411,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <