{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3821811ff1e343cdb759e746a0ec470f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Had a reply from our TA for pricing... more than we wanted, but not undoable. However the best package I can get for this gives me 1 week to get everyone&#039;s deposits in! That is very disappointing. We may end up looking into Riu Negril, they had the next best pricing. I have my heart set on GPJ though, so we&#039;ll see!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1711884,"PostDate":1359262930,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Had a reply from our TA for pricing... more than we wanted, but not undoable. However the best package I can get for this gives me 1 week to get everyone's deposits in! That is very disappointing. We may end up looking into Riu Negril, they had the next best pricing. I have my heart set on GPJ though, so we'll see!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f56c632ee16168d5aff590a3d49fca24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Looks like we may be getting it after all! Decided that between this or Riu, for the extra cost I think that this is the better choice. Now just have to try and get deposits in, dates booked, and then away we go!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713257,"PostDate":1359513572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Looks like we may be getting it after all! Decided that between this or Riu, for the extra cost I think that this is the better choice. Now just have to try and get deposits in, dates booked, and then away we go!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74b756c50a60698e5686606d3bc0e898","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I so far have found it difficult all our guests are booking individualy as some are going for different times flight upgrades etc so far we have 8 booked with another 3 booking this week and then 3 more in a couple of weeks then about 8 or 9 whenever they can.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I went dress shopping on monday and loved the 2nd dress i tried on exciting stuff.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Im going to a few more shops but so far i have a good idea what i want xxxx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713357,"PostDate":1359537538,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I so far have found it difficult all our guests are booking individualy as some are going for different times flight upgrades etc so far we have 8 booked with another 3 booking this week and then 3 more in a couple of weeks then about 8 or 9 whenever they can.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I went dress shopping on monday and loved the 2nd dress i tried on exciting stuff.<\/p> <p> Im going to a few more shops but so far i have a good idea what i want xxxx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6bc3cfef2351bee82b4164ad2b665cb","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrsjones2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Looks like we may be getting it after all! Decided that between this or Riu, for the extra cost I think that this is the better choice. Now just have to try and get deposits in, dates booked, and then away we go![\/quote] \n If you don&#039;t mind me asking, what was the rate you received?","Attachments":[],"Id":1713368,"PostDate":1359550164,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrsjones2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Looks like we may be getting it after all! Decided that between this or Riu, for the extra cost I think that this is the better choice. Now just have to try and get deposits in, dates booked, and then away we go!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> If you don't mind me asking, what was the rate you received?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee285319be13aaec5f79064303bc5558","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; we got it for \u00a31500 per person all inclusive for 2 weeks not sure what that is in dollars xxx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713578,"PostDate":1359570954,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> we got it for \u00a31500 per person all inclusive for 2 weeks not sure what that is in dollars xxx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"592f8086c5e6ec1d0e48a49af69f5729","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just booked our wedding at the Grand Palladium Jamaica for February 14, 2014! I am very excited for planning to get underway.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1715213,"PostDate":1359876526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just booked our wedding at the Grand Palladium Jamaica for February 14, 2014! I am very excited for planning to get underway.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marla_121@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359487009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265331.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marla Allard","Id":265331,"Name":"Marla Allard","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cfbcfff811f41af85744dd43c82eb28","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mjcf[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We just spoke to our travel agent yesterday and we&#039;re going from April 5-12 2014. Wedding date set for April 7, but I haven&#039;t spoke to the coordinator there yet. \n I&#039;m wondering what the private dinner reception prices are like. I heard it includes a dinner in the a la carte restaurants but it isn&#039;t private[\/quote] \n I have read some reviews and the price for the private reception are around $45\/person, depending on what you select for the menu. You can select either the Poseidon or Blue Lagoon restaurant and you have it from 6-10pm. I believe the free a la carte is for a maximum of 30 persons, and there is a private buffet option which is for groups of 50 or more if you want a buffet style.","Attachments":[],"Id":1715215,"PostDate":1359880027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mjcf<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We just spoke to our travel agent yesterday and we're going from April 5-12 2014. Wedding date set for April 7, but I haven't spoke to the coordinator there yet.<\/p> <p> I'm wondering what the private dinner reception prices are like. I heard it includes a dinner in the a la carte restaurants but it isn't private<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I have read some reviews and the price for the private reception are around $45\/person, depending on what you select for the menu. You can select either the Poseidon or Blue Lagoon restaurant and you have it from 6-10pm. I believe the free a la carte is for a maximum of 30 persons, and there is a private buffet option which is for groups of 50 or more if you want a buffet style.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marla_121@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359487009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265331.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marla Allard","Id":265331,"Name":"Marla Allard","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b0bdce1ab7868996d665c6ac5d4e6f6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Marla Allard[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I have read some reviews and the price for the private reception are around $45\/person, depending on what you select for the menu. You can select either the Poseidon or Blue Lagoon restaurant and you have it from 6-10pm. I believe the free a la carte is for a maximum of 30 persons, and there is a private buffet option which is for groups of 50 or more if you want a buffet style.[\/quote] \n Thank you! The coordinator did get back to me with pricing and all the menus, so this pretty much sums up what she told me.","Attachments":[],"Id":1715416,"PostDate":1359922208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Marla Allard<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I have read some reviews and the price for the private reception are around $45\/person, depending on what you select for the menu. You can select either the Poseidon or Blue Lagoon restaurant and you have it from 6-10pm. I believe the free a la carte is for a maximum of 30 persons, and there is a private buffet option which is for groups of 50 or more if you want a buffet style.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Thank you! The coordinator did get back to me with pricing and all the menus, so this pretty much sums up what she told me.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55557bae22bd3c42d5877d29d1287b16","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Received some bad news today that the Blue Lagoon is already booked for our date. Not very impressed as my fiance has a severe allergy to seafood and fish, and Poseidon is a seafood restaurant. I don&#039;t really trust that even if they can serve non-seafood dishes. I&#039;m not really keen on taking a risk like that on such an important day. I am hoping there are other options for a private reception otherwise I may have to change resorts. I really don&#039;t want to spend more than $45\/person, which is already steep enough, for the private buffet. Guess booking a year in advance wasn&#039;t early enough...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1715882,"PostDate":1360003727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Received some bad news today that the Blue Lagoon is already booked for our date. Not very impressed as my fiance has a severe allergy to seafood and fish, and Poseidon is a seafood restaurant. I don't really trust that even if they can serve non-seafood dishes. I'm not really keen on taking a risk like that on such an important day. I am hoping there are other options for a private reception otherwise I may have to change resorts. I really don't want to spend more than $45\/person, which is already steep enough, for the private buffet. Guess booking a year in advance wasn't early enough...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marla_121@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359487009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265331.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marla Allard","Id":265331,"Name":"Marla Allard","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"438de7d8877e7d042797a3aa89fe5c01","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My son is having the same problems, so has handed it over to me to sort out. &amp;nbsp;Rui is booked for most of January, so we are scrambling again with dates and location.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are now looking at this resort. I am not familiar with it. Adult only resort are out because of children attending.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So the $45.00 per person price they quoted is for a buffet as well, not a sit down?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1716162,"PostDate":1360030634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My son is having the same problems, so has handed it over to me to sort out. \u00a0Rui is booked for most of January, so we are scrambling again with dates and location.<\/p> <p> We are now looking at this resort. I am not familiar with it. Adult only resort are out because of children attending.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So the $45.00 per person price they quoted is for a buffet as well, not a sit down?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"annettehastie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.183.163.118","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1357327237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263868.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":126,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Annette Hastie","Id":263868,"Name":"Annette Hastie","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":164,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
