Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a6ebed9dcd936412cecf670f7389744","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mjcf[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n If you don&#039;t mind me asking, what was the rate you received?[\/quote] \n We&#039;ve been quoted about $2100 all in Vancouver - Montego Bay with a stop in Toronto. Or we can book Toronto to Montego for around $1700, and find our own flights to Toronto. \n \n Jamaica as we&#039;ve found is very difficult to get to from Vancouver! Not many groups fly there, so our options are limited. Especially with us wanting to go in May, it was even more difficult!","Attachments":[],"Id":1716187,"PostDate":1360032603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mjcf<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> If you don't mind me asking, what was the rate you received?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> We've been quoted about $2100 all in Vancouver - Montego Bay with\u00a0a stop in Toronto. Or we can book Toronto to Montego for around $1700, and find our own flights to Toronto.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Jamaica as we've found is very difficult to get to from Vancouver! Not many groups fly there, so our options are limited. Especially with us wanting to go in May, it was even more difficult!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7581130e91e98e4bdafe6afcecc19eb","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]photogirl0403[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi everyone! \n \n I am getting married at the GP on May 9th, 2014 at 4 PM on the beach!  I&#039;m so glad someone started this post for 2014 brides :)  I have been in contact with people at the GP, so I have received a lot of info from them.  If anyone has any questions, feel free to ask!  \n \n For the Ontario, Canada brides, do you mind me asking who is your travel agent?  And are there flights direct from Toronto?[\/quote] \n Do you have a coordinators email address? What information did you need to get a confirmation for a date and time? I&#039;ve heard differing stories, some deposits, some passport information, some nothing! Each resort is different  I can&#039;t wait to get menus and start locking down decisions! \n \n I&#039;m dealing out of Vancouver, but all our flights are Toronto - Montego Bay. We&#039;ve been using Marlin Travel, a group\/wedding specialist. She&#039;s amazing! A good friend of mine got married last year in Mexico and he recommended her. Great decision so far!","Attachments":[],"Id":1716200,"PostDate":1360034938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>photogirl0403<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi everyone!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am getting married at the GP on May 9th, 2014 at 4 PM on the beach!\u00a0 I'm so glad someone started this post for 2014 brides <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I have been in contact with people at the GP, so I have received a lot of info from them.\u00a0 If anyone has any questions, feel free to ask!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the Ontario, Canada brides, do you mind me asking who is your travel agent?\u00a0 And are there flights direct from Toronto?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Do you have a coordinators email address? What information did you need to get a confirmation for a date and time? I've heard differing stories, some deposits, some passport information, some nothing! Each resort is different\u00a0\u00a0I can't wait to get menus and start locking down decisions!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm dealing out of Vancouver, but all our flights are Toronto - Montego Bay. We've been using Marlin Travel, a group\/wedding specialist. She's amazing! A good friend of mine got married last year in Mexico and he recommended her. Great decision so far!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a94547aa41fdff521d2073faa9f4beb6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; They quoted me 55$ per person for the private buffet. It is a sit down. They set up tables etc on the beach, but it has to be for 50 or more guests. And it depends on the menu, the one we like is $60\/person.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1717512,"PostDate":1360252097,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> They quoted me 55$ per person for the private buffet. It is a sit down. They set up tables etc on the beach, but it has to be for 50 or more guests. And it depends on the menu, the one we like is $60\/person.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marla_121@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359487009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265331.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marla Allard","Id":265331,"Name":"Marla Allard","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1479223b4fe3c1ea5ea66a33ea9b5f67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Can someone please send me an email address of a coordinator who is active at the resort? I&#039;ve sent 2 emails in 3 weeks and no one has responded. We&#039;ve now started placing our guests&amp;nbsp;deposits through the TA, and I need to make sure that I can secure my date for the ceremony! As well, I need to start looking at menus and deciding what we&#039;d like to do for the reception.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks for any help you can provide!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1719756,"PostDate":1360693115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Can someone please send me an email address of a coordinator who is active at the resort? I've sent 2 emails in 3 weeks and no one has responded. We've now started placing our guests\u00a0deposits through the TA, and I need to make sure that I can secure my date for the ceremony! As well, I need to start looking at menus and deciding what we'd like to do for the reception.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for any help you can provide!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ddec4a542f873a48ba4df27fee672a6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrsjones2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Can someone please send me an email address of a coordinator who is active at the resort? I&#039;ve sent 2 emails in 3 weeks and no one has responded. We&#039;ve now started placing our guests deposits through the TA, and I need to make sure that I can secure my date for the ceremony! As well, I need to start looking at menus and deciding what we&#039;d like to do for the reception. \n \n Thanks for any help you can provide![\/quote] \n [color=#2A2A2A][font=Tahoma][size=3][background=rgb(243, 247, 253)]weddings.jamaica@palladiumhotelgroup.com is the email I&#039;ve been getting replies from. The coordinator&#039;s name is Erika. She takes awhile to reply, I&#039;ve been waiting a week to hear back from her since I sent her my deposit for the wedding.[\/background][\/size][\/font][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1719765,"PostDate":1360694715,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrsjones2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Can someone please send me an email address of a coordinator who is active at the resort? I've sent 2 emails in 3 weeks and no one has responded. We've now started placing our guests\u00a0deposits through the TA, and I need to make sure that I can secure my date for the ceremony! As well, I need to start looking at menus and deciding what we'd like to do for the reception.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for any help you can provide!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(42, 42, 42);font-family: Tahoma, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;background-color: rgb(243, 247, 253)\">weddings.jamaica@palladiumhotelgroup.com is the email I've been getting replies from. The coordinator's name is Erika. She takes awhile to reply, I've been waiting a week to hear back from her since I sent her my deposit for the wedding.<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d80c891db02cad53fc42060b05b12c4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks, that&#039;s the email I had tried previously. I&#039;ll try again and see what happens...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1720131,"PostDate":1360735161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks, that's the email I had tried previously. I'll try again and see what happens...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4f58d40ae5e585e6da47abbaa03e265","RawContent":"Just booked at the GPLH from April 5 to the 12, 2014.... Wedding on April 9, at 2 p.m. In the gazebo!! Sooo excited. My travel agent returns from Montego Bay tomorrow...he went to check out the resort for us and meet the staff and wedding coordinators for us. I can&#039;t wait to here what he has to say!","Attachments":[],"Id":1727285,"PostDate":1362099363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just booked at the GPLH from April 5 to the 12, 2014.... Wedding on April 9, at 2 p.m. In the gazebo!! Sooo excited. My travel agent returns from Montego Bay tomorrow...he went to check out the resort for us and meet the staff and wedding coordinators for us. I can't wait to here what he has to say!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindyleaman@hotmail.om","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362098921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CindyLou","Id":266722,"Name":"CindyLou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fc0eac404c78281d28a979153e62de3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It&#039;s so tough waiting for coordinators to reply! I just want to confirm a date for our wedding, and I can&#039;t get an answer! I&#039;ll be so sad if our date and time gets taken....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1728189,"PostDate":1362347705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It's so tough waiting for coordinators to reply! I just want to confirm a date for our wedding, and I can't get an answer! I'll be so sad if our date and time gets taken....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c731ad6af2bbd5fc87c3cf03143a4c4","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrsjones2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n It&#039;s so tough waiting for coordinators to reply! I just want to confirm a date for our wedding, and I can&#039;t get an answer! I&#039;ll be so sad if our date and time gets taken....[\/quote] \n Same here. I had originally asked Erika for our date and she said she put it on hold for us tentatively until we sent her a deposit, which I did 3 weeks ago, and I still haven&#039;t heard from her or had a charge put through to my credit card. I am so nervous about my date and time being taken! I wish she would reply faster, it is very frustrating.","Attachments":[],"Id":1728412,"PostDate":1362406008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrsjones2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> It's so tough waiting for coordinators to reply! I just want to confirm a date for our wedding, and I can't get an answer! I'll be so sad if our date and time gets taken....<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Same here. I had originally asked Erika for our date and she said she put it on hold for us tentatively until we sent her a deposit, which I did 3 weeks ago, and I still haven't heard from her or had a charge put through to my credit card. I am so nervous about my date and time being taken! I wish she would reply faster, it is very frustrating.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d17e9ad7929fda3bd7722accd62e98e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]CindyLou[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Just booked at the GPLH from April 5 to the 12, 2014.... Wedding on April 9, at 2 p.m. In the gazebo!! Sooo excited. My travel agent returns from Montego Bay tomorrow...he went to check out the resort for us and meet the staff and wedding coordinators for us. I can&#039;t wait to here what he has to say![\/quote] \n We&#039;re travelling from April 5-12th too!! Our wedding is the 7th! :) Mind if I ask where you&#039;re from?","Attachments":[],"Id":1728413,"PostDate":1362406102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>CindyLou<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Just booked at the GPLH from April 5 to the 12, 2014.... Wedding on April 9, at 2 p.m. In the gazebo!! Sooo excited. My travel agent returns from Montego Bay tomorrow...he went to check out the resort for us and meet the staff and wedding coordinators for us. I can't wait to here what he has to say!<\/blockquote> <p> We're travelling from April 5-12th too!! Our wedding is the 7th! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Mind if I ask where you're from?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":164,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
