{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe0f622105920eeb82830e8aac989916","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mjcf[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Same here. I had originally asked Erika for our date and she said she put it on hold for us tentatively until we sent her a deposit, which I did 3 weeks ago, and I still haven&#039;t heard from her or had a charge put through to my credit card. I am so nervous about my date and time being taken! I wish she would reply faster, it is very frustrating.[\/quote] \n I can&#039;t even get an acknowledgment of a request! I&#039;ve emailed twice in over 3 weeks, and have had zero response back. Going to try and see if my TA can have any luck. Who would have thought that trying to give a resort money would be so difficult :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1728680,"PostDate":1362424202,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mjcf<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Same here. I had originally asked Erika for our date and she said she put it on hold for us tentatively until we sent her a deposit, which I did 3 weeks ago, and I still haven't heard from her or had a charge put through to my credit card. I am so nervous about my date and time being taken! I wish she would reply faster, it is very frustrating.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I can't even get an acknowledgment of a request! I've emailed twice in over 3 weeks, and have had zero response back. Going to try and see if my TA can have any luck. Who would have thought that trying to give a resort money would be so difficult <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"765c18a269e085a9ac8e87b67b8dfe9d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrsjones2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I can&#039;t even get an acknowledgment of a request! I&#039;ve emailed twice in over 3 weeks, and have had zero response back. Going to try and see if my TA can have any luck. Who would have thought that trying to give a resort money would be so difficult :)[\/quote] \n Yes, I had asked my TA as well to try to contact her.  You&#039;d think they would take our money in a heartbeat lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1728803,"PostDate":1362435101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrsjones2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I can't even get an acknowledgment of a request! I've emailed twice in over 3 weeks, and have had zero response back. Going to try and see if my TA can have any luck. Who would have thought that trying to give a resort money would be so difficult <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Yes, I had asked my TA as well to try to contact her. \u00a0You'd think they would take our money in a heartbeat lol\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0931a64ceb58a8f060010e4e815757ed","RawContent":"W[quote name=\"mjcf\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any-2014-grand-palladium-jamaica-brides-about-yet\/30#post_1877982\"]We&#039;re travelling from April 5-12th too!! Our wedding is the 7th! :) Mind if I ask where you&#039;re from? [\/quotee] We are from New Brunswick, Canada! Has your wedding been confirmed yet? Ours was tentatively booked by Erika, we sent her the paperwork with a credit card number, but it&#039;s taking some time to hear back from her!","Attachments":[],"Id":1729563,"PostDate":1362524007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                W[quote name=\"mjcf\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any-2014-grand-palladium-jamaica-brides-about-yet\/30#post_1877982\"]We're travelling from April 5-12th too!! Our wedding is the 7th! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Mind if I ask where you're from? [\/quotee] We are from New Brunswick, Canada! Has your wedding been confirmed yet? Ours was tentatively booked by Erika, we sent her the paperwork with a credit card number, but it's taking some time to hear back from her!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindyleaman@hotmail.om","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362098921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CindyLou","Id":266722,"Name":"CindyLou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"253224d181beaa0bd6732908d230b06c","RawContent":"[quote]\n \n We are from New Brunswick, Canada! Has your wedding been confirmed yet? Ours was tentatively booked by Erika, we sent her the paperwork with a credit card number, but it&#039;s taking some time to hear back from her![\/quote]   \n We&#039;re from Ontario, flying out of Toronto. We had our date booked by Erika tentatively as well, we sent her all our info and it&#039;s been 3 weeks since we&#039;ve heard anything. I asked my travel agent to try to contact her, and she says hopefully this week we&#039;ll hear something. Fingers crossed!","Attachments":[],"Id":1729606,"PostDate":1362530030,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\"><div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> <br \/> We are from New Brunswick, Canada! Has your wedding been confirmed yet? Ours was tentatively booked by Erika, we sent her the paperwork with a credit card number, but it's taking some time to hear back from her!<\/blockquote> <\/div> <\/div> <p> We're from Ontario, flying out of Toronto. We had our date booked by Erika tentatively as well, we sent her all our info and it's been 3 weeks since we've heard anything. I asked my travel agent to try to contact her, and she says hopefully this week we'll hear something. Fingers crossed!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b23cdcdf6c320b602b0eb37f99e20277","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My credit card has been charged for the wedding deposit...guess that means my date and time have been confirmed!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1731032,"PostDate":1362756577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My credit card has been charged for the wedding deposit...guess that means my date and time have been confirmed!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindyleaman@hotmail.om","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362098921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CindyLou","Id":266722,"Name":"CindyLou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"881e5a8e13119ae7706cf478f316d55e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]CindyLou[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n My credit card has been charged for the wedding deposit...guess that means my date and time have been confirmed!![\/quote] \n Lucky you! That&#039;s great! Mine still hasn&#039;t been charged, but hopefully soon!","Attachments":[],"Id":1731226,"PostDate":1362776277,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>CindyLou<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> My credit card has been charged for the wedding deposit...guess that means my date and time have been confirmed!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Lucky you! That's great! Mine still hasn't been charged, but hopefully soon!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0e864e8e518d983b7d7196e9ed32768","RawContent":"You should soon! My travel agent visited the Lady Hamilton last week for us and spent 3 hours with Erika. He was very impressed with this resort. After staying at 5 resorts in Jamaica, he said this was hands down the best resort so far! He said we will be very pleased and it was a great choice!! Yay! Now to find out how many people will actually book, so we can begin the reception planning! If it&#039;s over 30, that means a private reception at $45 pp, above the $20 pp beyond the 8 for the ceremony....ouch!","Attachments":[],"Id":1731536,"PostDate":1362853292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You should soon! My travel agent visited the Lady Hamilton last week for us and spent 3 hours with Erika. He was very impressed with this resort. After staying at 5 resorts in Jamaica, he said this was hands down the best resort so far! He said we will be very pleased and it was a great choice!! Yay! Now to find out how many people will actually book, so we can begin the reception planning! If it's over 30, that means a private reception at $45 pp, above the $20 pp beyond the 8 for the ceremony....ouch!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindyleaman@hotmail.om","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362098921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CindyLou","Id":266722,"Name":"CindyLou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4daf3cb38bf35242b2f5276c6b0b878","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mjcf\"]\nWe&#039;re from Ontario, flying out of Toronto. We had our date booked by Erika tentatively as well, we sent her all our info and it&#039;s been 3 weeks since we&#039;ve heard anything. I asked my travel agent to try to contact her, and she says hopefully this week we&#039;ll hear something. Fingers crossed![\/quote] [quote name=\"mjcf\"]\nWe&#039;re travelling from April 5-12th too!! Our wedding is the 7th! :) Mind if I ask where you&#039;re from?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1731540,"PostDate":1362853578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"mjcf\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/30#post_1879175\"><p>We're from Ontario, flying out of Toronto. We had our date booked by Erika tentatively as well, we sent her all our info and it's been 3 weeks since we've heard anything. I asked my travel agent to try to contact her, and she says hopefully this week we'll hear something. Fingers crossed!<\/p><\/blockquote> <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"mjcf\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/30#post_1877982\"><p>We're travelling from April 5-12th too!! Our wedding is the 7th! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Mind if I ask where you're from?<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindyleaman@hotmail.om","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362098921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CindyLou","Id":266722,"Name":"CindyLou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db8d297759293e73e94e5e897569521e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mjcf\"]\nWe&#039;re from Ontario, flying out of Toronto. We had our date booked by Erika tentatively as well, we sent her all our info and it&#039;s been 3 weeks since we&#039;ve heard anything. I asked my travel agent to try to contact her, and she says hopefully this week we&#039;ll hear something. Fingers crossed![\/quote] [b]Wow! I can&#039;t figure out how to use this! Lol. I have guests flying from Toronto to Montego Bay...at least 3 that are for sure! Air Transat. Who are you flying with?[\/b]","Attachments":[],"Id":1731541,"PostDate":1362853821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"mjcf\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/30#post_1879175\"><p>We're from Ontario, flying out of Toronto. We had our date booked by Erika tentatively as well, we sent her all our info and it's been 3 weeks since we've heard anything. I asked my travel agent to try to contact her, and she says hopefully this week we'll hear something. Fingers crossed!<\/p><\/blockquote> <strong class='bbc'>Wow! I can't figure out how to use this! Lol. I have guests flying from Toronto to Montego Bay...at least 3 that are for sure! Air Transat. Who are you flying with?<\/strong>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindyleaman@hotmail.om","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362098921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CindyLou","Id":266722,"Name":"CindyLou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea73586a07a43e9e8270c25fb94a5432","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]CindyLou[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n You should soon! My travel agent visited the Lady Hamilton last week for us and spent 3 hours with Erika. He was very impressed with this resort. After staying at 5 resorts in Jamaica, he said this was hands down the best resort so far! He said we will be very pleased and it was a great choice!! Yay! Now to find out how many people will actually book, so we can begin the reception planning! If it&#039;s over 30, that means a private reception at $45 pp, above the $20 pp beyond the 8 for the ceremony....ouch![\/quote] \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]CindyLou[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [b]Wow! I can&#039;t figure out how to use this! Lol. I have guests flying from Toronto to Montego Bay...at least 3 that are for sure! Air Transat. Who are you flying with?[\/b][\/quote] \n It&#039;s always nice to hear a good review. A friend of a friend visited over Christmas and they were very impressed aswell, they said it was amazing and the food was very good. \n Yes it is going to get pretty pricey, we have 20 people coming for sure, and might get closer to 30. It will all be worth it though I&#039;m sure! \n We&#039;re flying with Air Transat too! We&#039;ll likely be on the same flight as your guests! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1731593,"PostDate":1362874386,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>CindyLou<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> You should soon! My travel agent visited the Lady Hamilton last week for us and spent 3 hours with Erika. He was very impressed with this resort. After staying at 5 resorts in Jamaica, he said this was hands down the best resort so far! He said we will be very pleased and it was a great choice!! Yay! Now to find out how many people will actually book, so we can begin the reception planning! If it's over 30, that means a private reception at $45 pp, above the $20 pp beyond the 8 for the ceremony....ouch!<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>CindyLou<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong>Wow! I can't figure out how to use this! Lol. I have guests flying from Toronto to Montego Bay...at least 3 that are for sure! Air Transat. Who are you flying with?<\/strong><\/blockquote> <p> It's always nice to hear a good review. A friend of a friend visited over Christmas and they were very impressed aswell, they said it was amazing and the food was very good.<\/p> <p> Yes it is going to get pretty pricey, we have 20 people coming for sure, and might get closer to 30. It will all be worth it though I'm sure!<\/p> <p> We're flying with Air Transat too! We'll likely be on the same flight as your guests! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":164,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
