Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"179d1ae203c6ce50d7e5683739686cc0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mjcf\"]\nIt&#039;s always nice to hear a good review. A friend of a friend visited over Christmas and they were very impressed aswell, they said it was amazing and the food was very good. Yes it is going to get pretty pricey, we have 20 people coming for sure, and might get closer to 30. It will all be worth it though I&#039;m sure! We&#039;re flying with Air Transat too! We&#039;ll likely be on the same flight as your guests! :) [b]Neat! My soon to be father-in-law, a groomsmen and his wife (also great friend) will be flying for sure...maybe a few more. It will be nice when the flight schedules are out. I am really hoping for an early morning flight...so much nicer to get their early in the day! We got engaged last year at the Gran Bahia Principe...we were there for a wedding...it was really nice too! [\/b][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1731609,"PostDate":1362876207,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"mjcf\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/30#post_1881162\"><p>It's always nice to hear a good review. A friend of a friend visited over Christmas and they were very impressed aswell, they said it was amazing and the food was very good. Yes it is going to get pretty pricey, we have 20 people coming for sure, and might get closer to 30. It will all be worth it though I'm sure! We're flying with Air Transat too! We'll likely be on the same flight as your guests! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <strong class='bbc'>Neat! My soon to be father-in-law, a groomsmen and his wife (also great friend) will be flying for sure...maybe a few more. It will be nice when the flight schedules are out. I am really hoping for an early morning flight...so much nicer to get their early in the day! We got engaged last year at the Gran Bahia Principe...we were there for a wedding...it was really nice too! <\/strong><\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindyleaman@hotmail.om","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362098921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CindyLou","Id":266722,"Name":"CindyLou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d236527488c471e2e0cc77966af218a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; hi ladies im from the uk and flying out to gplh on the 3rd april 2014 for our wedding on the 12th on the beach my travel agent was not great so ive conacted the resort myself to get a list of &#039;extras&#039;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; congratulations to you both might see you there!!! xxx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1731809,"PostDate":1362938114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> hi ladies im from the uk and flying out to gplh on the 3rd april 2014 for our wedding on the 12th on the beach my travel agent was not great so ive conacted the resort myself to get a list of 'extras'<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> congratulations to you both might see you there!!! xxx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c6b701e197c79d4e2c95f7ef3e250e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It&#039;s too bad that your TA wasn&#039;t helpful, mine has been great. We&#039;ve been having trouble getting a response from the resort, so she spent some time looking into sales managers, and managed to get an email response from Miami head office and then Erika within 2 days! Erika hasn&#039;t been in touch with me yet, but at least I feel better knowing I&#039;m on her radar :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We&#039;re flying with Air Canada, Vancouver - Toronto - Montego Bay (for some of us, maybe 20 people?) And then we have others (again maybe 20 people) flying from either Heathrow or Edinburgh to Jamaica. mrs p 2 be, I notice you&#039;re from England, who have you booked with? We had looked at Thomas Cook previously...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1734428,"PostDate":1363389381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It's too bad that your TA wasn't helpful, mine has been great. We've been having trouble getting a response from the resort, so she spent some time looking into sales managers, and managed to get an email response from Miami head office and then Erika within 2 days! Erika hasn't been in touch with me yet, but at least I feel better knowing I'm on her radar <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're flying with Air Canada, Vancouver - Toronto - Montego Bay (for some of us, maybe 20 people?) And then we have others (again maybe 20 people) flying from either Heathrow or Edinburgh to Jamaica. mrs p 2 be, I notice you're from England, who have you booked with? We had looked at Thomas Cook previously...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c78937776f9fcdb7c80fc74f46bb761","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; ive booked with thompson as they are the only travel agents who go to gplh or they where when I booked. I had quite a long chat\/moan\/cry at the manager of the store we have booked through ad things seem to be looking up!! they have finally done everything they were supposed to now so we are literally waiting top pay off and be in the hands of gp.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If u need any help or advice from the &amp;nbsp;&#039;uk&#039; side give me a shout ive found it a bit difficult as many brides here are usa or canada xxx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1734775,"PostDate":1363521793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> ive booked with thompson as they are the only travel agents who go to gplh or they where when I booked. I had quite a long chat\/moan\/cry at the manager of the store we have booked through ad things seem to be looking up!! they have finally done everything they were supposed to now so we are literally waiting top pay off and be in the hands of gp.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If u need any help or advice from the \u00a0'uk' side give me a shout ive found it a bit difficult as many brides here are usa or canada xxx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d04ee708121ecf93e152d5237e67e25","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrs p 2 be[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n ive booked with thompson as they are the only travel agents who go to gplh or they where when I booked. I had quite a long chat\/moan\/cry at the manager of the store we have booked through ad things seem to be looking up!! they have finally done everything they were supposed to now so we are literally waiting top pay off and be in the hands of gp. \n \n If u need any help or advice from the  &#039;uk&#039; side give me a shout ive found it a bit difficult as many brides here are usa or canada xxx[\/quote] \n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1735028,"PostDate":1363583015,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrs p 2 be<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> ive booked with thompson as they are the only travel agents who go to gplh or they where when I booked. I had quite a long chat\/moan\/cry at the manager of the store we have booked through ad things seem to be looking up!! they have finally done everything they were supposed to now so we are literally waiting top pay off and be in the hands of gp.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If u need any help or advice from the \u00a0'uk' side give me a shout ive found it a bit difficult as many brides here are usa or canada xxx<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a65c82049dfe6292f0a9705418313ed5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Has anyone started looking into Photographers, or hair and make up yet? I know it&#039;s early, but it&#039;s so hard to tell when is the right time to book these things! all I read about is how in demand the good ones are, but I guess that&#039;s a good sign!!! :) I want to get some prices from Rashel Edwards, and have been looking at Zuluspro Photography.. have heard great things about both of them!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any ideas from you guys kicking about yet?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736005,"PostDate":1363741403,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Has anyone started looking into Photographers, or hair and make up yet? I know it's early, but it's so hard to tell when is the right time to book these things! all I read about is how in demand the good ones are, but I guess that's a good sign!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I want to get some prices from Rashel Edwards, and have been looking at Zuluspro Photography.. have heard great things about both of them!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any ideas from you guys kicking about yet?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da5a36117702961e708bc0ec98f2f4f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Still haven&#039;t heard from the coordinator! It&#039;s been 7 weeks since I sent her all my information to book our wedding date, and still no reply back. Both my travel agent and myself have emailed her several times, and still nothing! Should I be worried?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1738525,"PostDate":1364311200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Still haven't heard from the coordinator! It's been 7 weeks since I sent her all my information to book our wedding date, and still no reply back. Both my travel agent and myself have emailed her several times, and still nothing! Should I be worried?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a348f22c19f30a861437de156c1b801e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mjcf\"]\nStill haven&#039;t heard from the coordinator! It&#039;s been 7 weeks since I sent her all my information to book our wedding date, and still no reply back. Both my travel agent and myself have emailed her several times, and still nothing! Should I be worried?[\/quote] [b]Oh, I hope you hear something soon. Which email address are you using?[\/b]","Attachments":[],"Id":1739799,"PostDate":1364522879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"mjcf\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/60#post_1888094\"><p>Still haven't heard from the coordinator! It's been 7 weeks since I sent her all my information to book our wedding date, and still no reply back. Both my travel agent and myself have emailed her several times, and still nothing! Should I be worried?<\/p><\/blockquote> <strong class='bbc'>Oh, I hope you hear something soon. Which email address are you using?<\/strong>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cindyleaman@hotmail.om","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362098921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CindyLou","Id":266722,"Name":"CindyLou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"296c0ec560fd6d2c1708f75af9f9b4c3","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mjcf[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Still haven&#039;t heard from the coordinator! It&#039;s been 7 weeks since I sent her all my information to book our wedding date, and still no reply back. Both my travel agent and myself have emailed her several times, and still nothing! Should I be worried?[\/quote] \n I feel the same!!! It&#039;s been about 4 weeks, and the only response back was to my TA, with a \"Thanks for recommending\" email. No info attached, and no response since. I&#039;ve booked the hotel and flights already, but no actual wedding stuff... good thing is that we&#039;re so far away, and if others are having this kind of trouble, hopefully no ones been able to book it before me! Ha!","Attachments":[],"Id":1740383,"PostDate":1364693412,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mjcf<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Still haven't heard from the coordinator! It's been 7 weeks since I sent her all my information to book our wedding date, and still no reply back. Both my travel agent and myself have emailed her several times, and still nothing! Should I be worried?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I feel the same!!! It's been about 4 weeks, and the only response\u00a0back was\u00a0to my TA, with a \"Thanks for recommending\" email. No info attached, and no response since. I've booked the hotel and flights already, but no actual wedding stuff... good thing is that we're so far away, and if others are having this kind of trouble, hopefully no ones been able to book it before me! Ha!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ad1ed02edee23ff26086e35a6f0ec90","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrsjones2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I feel the same!!! It&#039;s been about 4 weeks, and the only response back was to my TA, with a \"Thanks for recommending\" email. No info attached, and no response since. I&#039;ve booked the hotel and flights already, but no actual wedding stuff... good thing is that we&#039;re so far away, and if others are having this kind of trouble, hopefully no ones been able to book it before me! Ha![\/quote] \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]CindyLou[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [b]Oh, I hope you hear something soon. Which email address are you using?[\/b][\/quote] \n FINALLY it&#039;s confirmed!! Yay!","Attachments":[],"Id":1740473,"PostDate":1364746640,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrsjones2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I feel the same!!! It's been about 4 weeks, and the only response\u00a0back was\u00a0to my TA, with a \"Thanks for recommending\" email. No info attached, and no response since. I've booked the hotel and flights already, but no actual wedding stuff... good thing is that we're so far away, and if others are having this kind of trouble, hopefully no ones been able to book it before me! Ha!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>CindyLou<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong>Oh, I hope you hear something soon. Which email address are you using?<\/strong><\/blockquote> <p> FINALLY it's confirmed!! Yay!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":164,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
