 our travel agent has better luck contacting the coordinator, I hear she is really busy and hard to get ahold of... I am slightly freaking out that nothing will be available! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> Fingers crossed I will be posting in this group again!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mitchelle_Edwards@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.65.17","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364227593,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267768.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"medwards","Id":267768,"Name":"medwards","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"167e43dc9d541a923cb031f31ba18d47","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; will keep everything crossed for you xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1747338,"PostDate":1366142676,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> will keep everything crossed for you xx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a862e16178c3034a0ec65c4c1e915fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m considering the Grand Palladium for a &amp;nbsp;July 2014 wedding. Does anyone know what the rates might be around this time? I would be flying out from Toronto.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1755155,"PostDate":1367894177,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi,\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm considering the Grand Palladium for a \u00a0July 2014 wedding. Does anyone know what the rates might be around this time? I would be flying out from Toronto.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rashena_s@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364132933,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267723.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Denise224","Id":267723,"Name":"Denise224","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc9b711630902a5b5399440904498ff6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Has anyone booked their dinner reception yet? I&#039;m thinking we&#039;ll have ours at the blue lagoon...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1755218,"PostDate":1367933825,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Has anyone booked their dinner reception yet? I'm thinking we'll have ours at the blue lagoon...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michellefoye@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.39.80.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357851227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264230.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mjcf","Id":264230,"Name":"mjcf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97d5e261990dc2a452c0a077254206d4","RawContent":"I&#039;ve booked my reception at the Blue Lagoon for May 9th!","Attachments":[],"Id":1755239,"PostDate":1367939684,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've booked my reception at the Blue Lagoon for May 9th!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"photogirl0403@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.180.236.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351559465,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261894.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":204,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photogirl0403","Id":261894,"Name":"photogirl0403","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba3065345db4d9381e1a0c684a97dde8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; we are not having the private dinner we are just going to book one of the al a cartes we only have a small party coming and are trying to keep costs down as much as possible xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1755253,"PostDate":1367941372,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> we are not having the private dinner we are just going to book one of the al a cartes we only have a small party coming and are trying to keep costs down as much as possible xx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bicky2000uk@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"176.251.179.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357826306,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264206.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrs p 2 be","Id":264206,"Name":"mrs p 2 be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f09b647fd315ecf5917742e5f42d1895","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just booked today for May 3, 2014, at 2:00pm. The 4:00pm slot was already booked &lt;span alt=\":(\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368033116113_933\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\"&gt;:-( , but 2:00 should be fine, right? &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\"&gt;I am SUPER excited to FINALLY book! I have been planning this for a YEAR, but haven&#039;t been able to book until now because flight schedules are only available one year in advance. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\"&gt;We booked for April 29-May 6th, 2014. Our price is $1978 pp (tax in), which is higher than I wanted people to have to pay, but seeing as we are going from one tropical island another (NEWFOUNDLAND to JAMAICA), the prices don&#039;t go any lower than that!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\"&gt;I am really excited to finally book! The past couple of months my travel agent, Katie Baird of TPI Travel, has been working hard constantly pricing trips from January-May for 3 different hotels (our top 3 were Iberostar, GP, and Gran Bahai). But its an awesome feeling to have finally decided on place and time! :-) &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1755707,"PostDate":1368033355,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just booked today for May 3, 2014, at 2:00pm. The 4:00pm slot was already booked <span alt=\":(\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1368033116113_933\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\">:-( , but 2:00 should be fine, right? <\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\">I am SUPER excited to FINALLY book! I have been planning this for a YEAR, but haven't been able to book until now because flight schedules are only available one year in advance. <\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\">We booked for April 29-May 6th, 2014. Our price is $1978 pp (tax in), which is higher than I wanted people to have to pay, but seeing as we are going from one tropical island another (NEWFOUNDLAND to JAMAICA), the prices don't go any lower than that!!<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\">I am really excited to finally book! The past couple of months my travel agent, Katie Baird of TPI Travel, has been working hard constantly pricing trips from January-May for 3 different hotels (our top 3 were Iberostar, GP, and Gran Bahai). But its an awesome feeling to have finally decided on place and time! :-) <\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanie_tiller@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346169164,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259712.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stiller","Id":259712,"Name":"Stiller","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":164,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
