{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b16a3ebb2cdd4d69e8cb421c152f1662","RawContent":"Hi everyone, Congradulations to all the ladies! You gals are such early planners! I live in Vancouver, BC Canada and is currently using Fligt Centre TA as they have a destination wedding special office located in North Van. The TA is currently sending out a quote request to different airline\/vacation providers for a quote on 3 different resorts. Once the quote is in we willmake a final decision on resort, but i have my heart set on GPJ! My wedding date is Feb 20-24, 2014 (im flexible). Question: where do i find more information on the different venues available for private recption? Like pics of Blue Lagoon etc to see thr ambiance? Any info appreciated! Happy planning ladies!","Attachments":[],"Id":1756032,"PostDate":1368099820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone, Congradulations to all the ladies! You gals are such early planners! I live in Vancouver, BC Canada and is currently using Fligt Centre TA as they have a destination wedding special office located in North Van. The TA is currently sending out a quote request to different airline\/vacation providers for a quote on 3 different resorts. Once the quote is in we willmake a final decision on resort, but i have my heart set on GPJ! My wedding date is Feb 20-24, 2014 (im flexible). Question: where do i find more information on the different venues available for private recption? Like pics of Blue Lagoon etc to see thr ambiance? Any info appreciated! Happy planning ladies!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherinez@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368097296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269429.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katez","Id":269429,"Name":"katez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b1aac118e72ae207821eaad7d811580","RawContent":"Just booked june 2, 2014! Wooohoooo!!!!! Does any one have a DJ or a photographer that they can reommend? Besides the ones the resort gives.. Thanks in advance and good luck with all the planning girls! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1759882,"PostDate":1369184009,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just booked june 2, 2014! Wooohoooo!!!!! Does any one have a DJ or a photographer that they can reommend? Besides the ones the resort gives.. Thanks in advance and good luck with all the planning girls! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elunia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363982629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267676.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Truskawka","Id":267676,"Name":"Truskawka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"701f0925e334b61375217a33a56a374d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Marla Allard\"]\nI have read some reviews and the price for the private reception are around $45\/person, depending on what you select for the menu. You can select either the Poseidon or Blue Lagoon restaurant and you have it from 6-10pm. I believe the free a la carte is for a maximum of 30 persons, and there is a private buffet option which is for groups of 50 or more if you want a buffet style.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1759884,"PostDate":1369184375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Marla Allard\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/30#post_1864783\"><p>I have read some reviews and the price for the private reception are around $45\/person, depending on what you select for the menu. You can select either the Poseidon or Blue Lagoon restaurant and you have it from 6-10pm. I believe the free a la carte is for a maximum of 30 persons, and there is a private buffet option which is for groups of 50 or more if you want a buffet style.<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elunia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363982629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267676.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Truskawka","Id":267676,"Name":"Truskawka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84dccb63d9ef4ced1650dbc9a6a304b8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Marla Allard\"]\nI have read some reviews and the price for the private reception are around $45\/person, depending on what you select for the menu. You can select either the Poseidon or Blue Lagoon restaurant and you have it from 6-10pm. I believe the free a la carte is for a maximum of 30 persons, and there is a private buffet option which is for groups of 50 or more if you want a buffet style.[\/quote] A la carte is cheaper bc its with other people in the restaurant, private receptionis min $45 to $70 per person. Unless u choose a different menu, gala menu - then the price can go up to $90 per person (most expensive) for private reception u can choose either poseidon or the blue lagoon. If u want a buffet style reception (beach available) you need a min of 50 people","Attachments":[],"Id":1759886,"PostDate":1369184835,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Marla Allard\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/30#post_1864783\"><p>I have read some reviews and the price for the private reception are around $45\/person, depending on what you select for the menu. You can select either the Poseidon or Blue Lagoon restaurant and you have it from 6-10pm. I believe the free a la carte is for a maximum of 30 persons, and there is a private buffet option which is for groups of 50 or more if you want a buffet style.<\/p><\/blockquote> A la carte is cheaper bc its with other people in the restaurant, private receptionis min $45 to $70 per person. Unless u choose a different menu, gala menu - then the price can go up to $90 per person (most expensive) for private reception u can choose either poseidon or the blue lagoon. If u want a buffet style reception (beach available) you need a min of 50 people\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elunia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363982629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267676.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Truskawka","Id":267676,"Name":"Truskawka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36ae7bca06c9a91586c1fd8286fa0cda","RawContent":"I am looking for a photgrapher and a DJ. If someone knws anybody good and inexpensive, please let me know. Thank u so much! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1759889,"PostDate":1369185142,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am looking for a photgrapher and a DJ. If someone knws anybody good and inexpensive, please let me know. Thank u so much! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elunia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363982629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267676.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Truskawka","Id":267676,"Name":"Truskawka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f66ffcd8051205fe85625a6a0428369","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; So we&#039;ve booked! Finally :) May 5th, 2014 4pm. We had been looking for the 6th, but the time was taken, and I didn&#039;t fancy having the ceremony any earlier than that. When I sent in my info for the deposit, she also confirmed that we could have the Poseidon as well, which is perfect. Yay!&amp;nbsp;The only other things I&#039;m worried about looking at now is Hair\/Makeup, and photography. Once we book those, I&#039;m so happy to sit&amp;nbsp;back and relax until we get closer. No sense at all worrying about menus and spaces and entertainment until we&#039;re at least in the same year :) &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1761603,"PostDate":1369674238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So we've booked! Finally <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> May 5th, 2014 4pm. We had been looking for the 6th, but the time was taken, and I didn't fancy having the ceremony any earlier than that. When I sent in my info for the deposit, she also confirmed that we could have the Poseidon as well, which is perfect. Yay!\u00a0The only other things I'm worried about looking at now is Hair\/Makeup, and photography. Once we book those, I'm so happy to sit\u00a0back and relax until we get closer. No sense at all worrying about menus and spaces and entertainment until we're at least in the same year <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph.lindahl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357272931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsjones2014","Id":263841,"Name":"mrsjones2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0565e3a7e5624f77e77ddf8c4adae1e0","RawContent":"Hi all, Just engaged! GP is my dream so hoping it doesn&#039;t take too long for a reply from them! Just emailed yesterday, looking at a few dates in April. I am a little unsure about how exactly the pricing works with the ceremony (ie. how many ppl are free, if any) and how the receptions work(privacy, cost, etc.)? I am looking to keep costs down but would def. like a la carte and not buffet. Thinking the guest list will be about 30. Not sure how many will confirm but would love to get same date so I can get save the dates out to allow for my guests to save and book. I am in NY and need a travel agent. Does anyone feel that they got a great deal and love their TA? Looking forward to your replies. Congrats and good luck to all. :) Kristy","Attachments":[],"Id":1762699,"PostDate":1369935238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi all, Just engaged! GP is my dream so hoping it doesn't take too long for a reply from them! Just emailed yesterday, looking at a few dates in April. I am a little unsure about how exactly the pricing works with the ceremony (ie. how many ppl are free, if any) and how the receptions work(privacy, cost, etc.)? I am looking to keep costs down but would def. like a la carte and not buffet. Thinking the guest list will be about 30. Not sure how many will confirm but would love to get same date so I can get save the dates out to allow for my guests to save and book. I am in NY and need a travel agent. Does anyone feel that they got a great deal and love their TA? Looking forward to your replies. Congrats and good luck to all. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Kristy\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soontobemrsrobertc@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.46.116.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357232344,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263793.jpg?_r=1386856747","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KristyC","Id":263793,"Name":"KristyC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d7abcbe967e4c4222f36235335273ba","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mjcf\"]\nYes, next time I need to get in touch with them, I will for sure call the resort myself.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1762700,"PostDate":1369935298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"mjcf\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/60#post_1892931\"><p>Yes, next time I need to get in touch with them, I will for sure call the resort myself.<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soontobemrsrobertc@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.46.116.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357232344,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263793.jpg?_r=1386856747","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KristyC","Id":263793,"Name":"KristyC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ef5f1c46965c5eab45e8ab7707db757","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]snorfle1[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Congratulations! I have found this site so helpful in my planning.  I am a way early starter, have to wait until Dec 2014 for the big day..lol. I was planning on getting married at the beach until I saw the gazebo now I just don&#039;t know.  We will probably decide once we get there.[\/quote] \n just fyi, I just got back, Gazebo to me is def the way to go!!  Its gorgeous!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1764149,"PostDate":1370335574,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>snorfle1<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Congratulations! I have found this site so helpful in my planning.\u00a0 I am a way early starter, have to wait until Dec 2014 for the big day..lol. I was planning on getting married at the beach until I saw the gazebo now I just don't know.\u00a0 We will probably decide once we get there.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> just fyi, I just got back, Gazebo to me is def the way to go!!\u00a0 Its gorgeous!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wilson.julia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347542886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260322.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"n2godsheart","Id":260322,"Name":"n2godsheart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ad790203e6ce22a9a765d9e858cca81","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrsjones2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n So we&#039;ve booked! Finally :) May 5th, 2014 4pm. We had been looking for the 6th, but the time was taken, and I didn&#039;t fancy having the ceremony any earlier than that. When I sent in my info for the deposit, she also confirmed that we could have the Poseidon as well, which is perfect. Yay! The only other things I&#039;m worried about looking at now is Hair\/Makeup, and photography. Once we book those, I&#039;m so happy to sit back and relax until we get closer. No sense at all worrying about menus and spaces and entertainment until we&#039;re at least in the same year :)[\/quote] \n Stacey Clarke--  is THE BEST :)   I HIGHLY recommend her. She did my wedding at GP last week. She&#039;s awesome and took amazing pics. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1764150,"PostDate":1370335651,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrsjones2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> So we've booked! Finally <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> May 5th, 2014 4pm. We had been looking for the 6th, but the time was taken, and I didn't fancy having the ceremony any earlier than that. When I sent in my info for the deposit, she also confirmed that we could have the Poseidon as well, which is perfect. Yay!\u00a0The only other things I'm worried about looking at now is Hair\/Makeup, and photography. Once we book those, I'm so happy to sit\u00a0back and relax until we get closer. No sense at all worrying about menus and spaces and entertainment until we're at least in the same year <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Stacey Clarke--\u00a0 is THE BEST <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0 I HIGHLY recommend her. She did my wedding at GP last week. She's awesome and took amazing pics. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wilson.julia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347542886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260322.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"n2godsheart","Id":260322,"Name":"n2godsheart","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":164,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":100,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
