Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ddb1d5b0730d9095ce1ff58c0592e7b","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrsjones2014[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Has anyone started looking into Photographers, or hair and make up yet? I know it&#039;s early, but it&#039;s so hard to tell when is the right time to book these things! all I read about is how in demand the good ones are, but I guess that&#039;s a good sign!!! :) I want to get some prices from Rashel Edwards, and have been looking at Zuluspro Photography.. have heard great things about both of them! \n \n Any ideas from you guys kicking about yet?[\/quote] \n Rashel is the way to go. I had Pretty FAces though but- She did a great job too :)  As you can see, Idk anything about Zuluspro... but another one to look into is Stacey Clarke... along with a TTD the next day. Very creative and awesome!","Attachments":[],"Id":1764151,"PostDate":1370335836,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrsjones2014<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84026\/any-2014-grand-palladium-jamaica-brides-about-yet\/60#post_1885574' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> Has anyone started looking into Photographers, or hair and make up yet? I know it's early, but it's so hard to tell when is the right time to book these things! all I read about is how in demand the good ones are, but I guess that's a good sign!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I want to get some prices from Rashel Edwards, and have been looking at Zuluspro Photography.. have heard great things about both of them!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Any ideas from you guys kicking about yet?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Rashel is the way to go. I had Pretty FAces though but- She did a great job too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 As you can see, Idk anything about Zuluspro... but another one to look into is Stacey Clarke... along with a TTD the next day. Very creative and awesome!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wilson.julia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347542886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260322.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"n2godsheart","Id":260322,"Name":"n2godsheart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1be56e2d4ce183efe357979aa9cb9719","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]n2godsheart[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Stacey Clarke--  is THE BEST :)   I HIGHLY recommend her. She did my wedding at GP last week. She&#039;s awesome and took amazing pics. :)[\/quote] \n our sneak peek from Stacey on fbook \n \n [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/#!\/media\/set\/?set=a.554719611240541.1073741843.130607250318448&amp;amp;type=1\"]https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/#!\/media\/set\/?set=a.554719611240541.1073741843.130607250318448&amp;amp;type=1[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1764152,"PostDate":1370336132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>n2godsheart<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84026\/any-2014-grand-palladium-jamaica-brides-about-yet\/90#post_1912219' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> Stacey Clarke--\u00a0 is THE BEST <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0 I HIGHLY recommend her. She did my wedding at GP last week. She's awesome and took amazing pics. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> our sneak peek from Stacey on fbook<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/#!\/media\/set\/?set=a.554719611240541.1073741843.130607250318448&type=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...50318448&type=1<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wilson.julia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347542886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260322.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"n2godsheart","Id":260322,"Name":"n2godsheart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"868016246e64773ec7af49dad0a3a1bb","RawContent":"Just booked March 5, 2014 at 4pm. :) Can&#039;t decide location: Beach vs Gazebo, anyone who&#039;s been there before, does the Gazebo look better in real life than their photo?? Also: Photography, I&#039;m booking with Stacey Clarke, she has AMAZING photos!! She will cover the $300 USD Outside Vendor fee Palladium charges, and I find her packages very reasonable. Question for the PJ brides: Wedding packages: has anyone heard if it is possible to make modifications for each package? For example, the most basic package only has a one tier cake, what if I like the decorations but want more cake tiers, or change flowers to orchids? Has anyone talked to any staff there about this? Thanks and happy planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1765951,"PostDate":1370726925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just booked March 5, 2014 at 4pm. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Can't decide location: Beach vs Gazebo, anyone who's been there before, does the Gazebo look better in real life than their photo?? Also: Photography, I'm booking with Stacey Clarke, she has AMAZING photos!! She will cover the $300 USD Outside Vendor fee Palladium charges, and I find her packages very reasonable. Question for the PJ brides: Wedding packages: has anyone heard if it is possible to make modifications for each package? For example, the most basic package only has a one tier cake, what if I like the decorations but want more cake tiers, or change flowers to orchids? Has anyone talked to any staff there about this? Thanks and happy planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherinez@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368097296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269429.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katez","Id":269429,"Name":"katez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce3270c2a122ffee8d0b0f6f7de8a382","RawContent":"I&#039;m on the road bu[quote name=\"katez\"]\nJust booked March 5, 2014 at 4pm. :) Can&#039;t decide location: Beach vs Gazebo, anyone who&#039;s been there before, does the Gazebo look better in real life than their photo?? Also: Photography, I&#039;m booking with Stacey Clarke, she has AMAZING photos!! She will cover the $300 USD Outside Vendor fee Palladium charges, and I find her packages very reasonable. Question for the PJ brides: Wedding packages: has anyone heard if it is possible to make modifications for each package? For example, the most basic package only has a one tier cake, what if I like the decorations but want more cake tiers, or change flowers to orchids? Has anyone talked to any staff there about this? Thanks and happy planning![\/quote]t I can send u pics ... Personally I think the gazebo is way better. it poured my wedding day so I has to have it at the spa but we went to the site prior and I totally think its the way to go.","Attachments":[],"Id":1765967,"PostDate":1370735105,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm on the road bu<blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"katez\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/90#post_1914020\"><p>Just booked March 5, 2014 at 4pm. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Can't decide location: Beach vs Gazebo, anyone who's been there before, does the Gazebo look better in real life than their photo?? Also: Photography, I'm booking with Stacey Clarke, she has AMAZING photos!! She will cover the $300 USD Outside Vendor fee Palladium charges, and I find her packages very reasonable. Question for the PJ brides: Wedding packages: has anyone heard if it is possible to make modifications for each package? For example, the most basic package only has a one tier cake, what if I like the decorations but want more cake tiers, or change flowers to orchids? Has anyone talked to any staff there about this? Thanks and happy planning!<\/p><\/blockquote>t I can send u pics ... Personally I think the gazebo is way better. it poured my wedding day so I has to have it at the spa but we went to the site prior and I totally think its the way to go.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wilson.julia4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347542886,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260322.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"n2godsheart","Id":260322,"Name":"n2godsheart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"029fb61ec30198f217ba657f4f6472f5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Stiller\"]\nI just booked today for May 3, 2014, at 2:00pm. The 4:00pm slot was already booked :-( , but 2:00 should be fine, right? I am SUPER excited to FINALLY book! I have been planning this for a YEAR, but haven&#039;t been able to book until now because flight schedules are only available one year in advance. We booked for April 29-May 6th, 2014. Our price is $1978 pp (tax in), which is higher than I wanted people to have to pay, but seeing as we.....[\/quote] I believe the rate you quoted $1978pp is your R\/T Airfare Rate correct? Or is it the Resort rate for 7 days? Can you tell me did the GP give you the 2013 Resort Rates or did they make you pay the 2014 Rates when your Wedding takes place? Congratulations &amp; thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1768268,"PostDate":1371210896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Stiller\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/60#post_1903776\"><p>I just booked today for May 3, 2014, at 2:00pm. The 4:00pm slot was already booked :-( , but 2:00 should be fine, right? I am SUPER excited to FINALLY book! I have been planning this for a YEAR, but haven't been able to book until now because flight schedules are only available one year in advance. We booked for April 29-May 6th, 2014. Our price is $1978 pp (tax in), which is higher than I wanted people to have to pay, but seeing as we.....<\/p><\/blockquote> I believe the rate you quoted $1978pp is your R\/T Airfare Rate correct? Or is it the Resort rate for 7 days? Can you tell me did the GP give you the 2013 Resort Rates or did they make you pay the 2014 Rates when your Wedding takes place? Congratulations & thank you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Thanks and I wish you all the happiness in the world!","Email":"lisa.capo@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.46.116.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371185937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270576.jpg?_r=1388249780","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LizLiz","Id":270576,"Name":"LizLiz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a226375785811fb716258dd7a2e65873","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Truskawka\"]\nJust booked june 2, 2014! Wooohoooo!!!!! Thanks in advance and good luck with all the planning girls! :)[\/quote] Would you mind telling me if the GP gave you 2013 Resort ROOM\/SUITE Rates or did they make you pay the 2014 Room Rates when the Wedding takes place? Thanks a bunch &amp; Congratulations!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1768269,"PostDate":1371211208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Truskawka\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/60#post_1907951\"><p>Just booked june 2, 2014! Wooohoooo!!!!! Thanks in advance and good luck with all the planning girls! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/blockquote> Would you mind telling me if the GP gave you 2013 Resort ROOM\/SUITE Rates or did they make you pay the 2014 Room Rates when the Wedding takes place? Thanks a bunch & Congratulations!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Thanks and I wish you all the happiness in the world!","Email":"lisa.capo@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.46.116.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371185937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270576.jpg?_r=1388249780","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LizLiz","Id":270576,"Name":"LizLiz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3fca26cbe12248a515c88f1742f6e42","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Marla Allard\"]\nI just booked our wedding at the Grand Palladium Jamaica for February 14, 2014! I am very excited for planning to get underway.[\/quote] Yeah! Congrats to you! \u00f0\u0178\u201d\u201d\u00f0\u0178\u201d\u201d Can you tell me did you have to pay the GP Resort ROOM\/SUITE Rates for 2014 since you will be there in 2014? OR Did they give you 2013 rates since you booked your stay during 2013? I haven&#039;t been able to access rates for 2014. The booking online only gives you availability until December 31, 2013.... \u00f0\u0178\u02dc\u0178","Attachments":[],"Id":1768273,"PostDate":1371212244,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Marla Allard\" url=\"\/t\/84026\/any&#045;2014&#045;grand&#045;palladium&#045;jamaica&#045;brides&#045;about&#045;yet\/30#post_1864781\"><p>I just booked our wedding at the Grand Palladium Jamaica for February 14, 2014! I am very excited for planning to get underway.<\/p><\/blockquote> Yeah! Congrats to you! \u00f0\u0178\u201d\u201d\u00f0\u0178\u201d\u201d Can you tell me did you have to pay the GP Resort ROOM\/SUITE Rates for 2014 since you will be there in 2014? OR Did they give you 2013 rates since you booked your stay during 2013? I haven't been able to access rates for 2014. The booking online only gives you availability until December 31, 2013.... \u00f0\u0178\u02dc\u0178\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Thanks and I wish you all the happiness in the world!","Email":"lisa.capo@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.46.116.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371185937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270576.jpg?_r=1388249780","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LizLiz","Id":270576,"Name":"LizLiz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fff73448b36dbfc1858cdb26ee90d6a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have just booked my dates for next year for the lady hamilton. Our party flies out on the 11th April 2014, just picked our dates to get married, still waiting for a response to make sure one of these is all okay.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1768657,"PostDate":1371298397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have just booked my dates for next year for the lady hamilton. Our party flies out on the 11th April 2014, just picked our dates to get married, still waiting for a response to make sure one of these is all okay.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"betty_boo_b0018@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"151.227.21.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371297102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270608.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BecciBoo","Id":270608,"Name":"BecciBoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1d3039fc82d4b5a7e892a28907d414e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes, our party are flying out on the 11th April 2014. &amp;nbsp;We are waiting for a response to see if the dates we have requested are okay.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1768658,"PostDate":1371298465,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes, our party are flying out on the 11th April 2014. \u00a0We are waiting for a response to see if the dates we have requested are okay.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"betty_boo_b0018@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"151.227.21.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371297102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270608.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BecciBoo","Id":270608,"Name":"BecciBoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71738,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a90aa74b21cd0d13cbcedff948d6067c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes we are getting married there April 2014. &amp;nbsp;Fly out from the UK on the 11th April. &amp;nbsp;Just waiting to hear back to see if our dates that we have picked to get married, one of them is choosen.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1768659,"PostDate":1371298568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes we are getting married there April 2014. \u00a0Fly out from the UK on the 11th April. \u00a0Just waiting to hear back to see if our dates that we have picked to get married, one of them is choosen.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"betty_boo_b0018@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"151.227.21.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1371297102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270608.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BecciBoo","Id":270608,"Name":"BecciBoo","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":164,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":110,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications